      "name": "Scuttling Attack",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The morlock scavenger Strides twice, ignoring difficult terrain caused by natural cavern features like rubble or stalagmites. At any point during its movement, the morlock can make a melee Strike against an enemy in its reach."
