  "text": "The morlock scavenger is a lankier, smaller version of a typical morlock. Their stature allows them to wriggle into areas other morlocks can't access.\n\n---\n\nMorlocks originate from humans long lost to the surface world. They have an affinity for machinery, scavenging, and strange occult behaviors."
